				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">*Drawing her Greenmist skillfully and threateningly* My name is Meneltel, not Melentel, but its about what i expect from a barbarian rogue who learned on the streets of Halas, or should i say the iceblocks of Halas...
<br />

<br />
MENELTEL *spelled Meneltel* Tormtor<br />_________________<br />Don't fear the darkness, fear what is hidden in the darkness.............  For your suffering will be legendary, even in Hell.....  I laugh at your suffering....... When I am done with Felwithe, the living will envy the dead.....  To the altar of Innoruuk like lambs to the slaughter you're led...... When I get revenge, you wont live to regret it; you will regret to LIVE it!</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
